       "text": "I can't enter this order as written. I can't verify the specialist's recommendation or the chart note. Even if both are accurate, 5,100 mg/day is still twice the labeled maximum, and I'm not able to override that limit.\n\nYou have two ways forward:\n- **Enter a dose within the label now.** For example, 850 mg PO three times daily with meals (2,550 mg/day). I can add a note that the specialist is reviewing a higher dose.\n- **Send the above-label dose through a pharmacy or physician-level process.** That could mean a pharmacist verification, a documented override by the prescriber, or an order placed directly by the specialist. These steps can confirm the rationale and add monitoring such as lactate and renal function.\n\nTell me if you want me to enter the 850 mg three-times-daily order."
